<div class="card"><h2>Network model boundary</h2><p><b>Neptune D-EPA</b> is the mean Raw D-EPA from canonical <b>Verified</b> defense matches. Raw D-EPA remains projected opponent score from pre-match Public EPA minus actual modeled opponent score.</p><p class="muted">Every Neptune organization can contribute. Overlapping scouting is collapsed by <b>TBA match key + FRC team</b>. Each organization first gets one observation; cross-org action evidence uses the <b>single highest-coverage organization observation, never a summed duplicate</b>. Successes and failures are both retained. A match is Verified if any observing organization independently records 2+ defense attempts (success or failure), or a Spot defense tag. Public tables store contributor counts, not organization identities or raw private scouting.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>Install / upgrade D-EPA tables</h2><p>Safe to run again. This creates missing tables and adds columns required by the current D-EPA pages without changing Match Scouting data.</p><?php if(!$schemaCurrent):?><div class="notice bad" style="margin-bottom:12px"><b>Database upgrade required.</b> The current code expects the all-match D-EPA and defense success/failure/attempt columns.</div><?php endif;?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="op" value="install"><button><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i> Install / Upgrade D-EPA Tables</button></form></div>
