<div class="card"><h2>Backfill / rebuild</h2><p>Rebuilds Public EPA-based Raw D-EPA, reads scouting from <b>all organizations</b>, deduplicates overlapping robot/match observations, and regenerates public event and season Neptune D-EPA ratings.</p><form method="post" class="depa-actions"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="op" value="rebuild"><label>Start season<input type="number" name="start_year" min="1992" max="<?=$current+1?>" value="<?=$current?>"></label><label>End season<input type="number" name="end_year" min="1992" max="<?=$current+1?>" value="<?=$current?>"></label><button <?=$running?'disabled':''?>><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> <?=$running?'Rebuild Running…':'Start Neptune D-EPA Rebuild'?></button></form><p class="muted">Prerequisite: the Public EPA archive must already be populated for the season. A Neptune organization only contributes to a robot/match when it actually recorded scouting actions or a Spot observation for that robot in that TBA match.</p></div>
